    "files": [
      {
        "description": "This archive contains the mass spectra corresponding to the LC-MS analyses of DCLs in Chapter 6 are available as separate PNG images of the raw data. The mass spectra are sorted by building block (or building block combination) in separate folders. For example: the folder “1” contains the mass spectra from a DCL containing building block 1. Similarly, the folder “1+2D” contains the mass spectra from a DCL containing equal amounts of building blocks 1 and 2D. The files in each folder are named with the macrocycle size of the molecules that they correspond to. \n\nThe file “Expected vs detected masses.xlsx” lists all the calculated and detected masses corresponding to the mono-isotopic peak for each detected macrocycle.",
        "label": "Mass Spectra Chapter 6.zip",
        "restricted": false,
